  "quiz_markdown": "### Q1. Classical texture often features:\n\n- A) Clear melody with accompaniment\n- B) Unstructured noise\n- C) Only 7/8 meter\n- D) No phrases\n\n**Answer:** A\n\n### Q2. Sonata form: exposition, development, recapitulation.\n\n**Answer:** True",
